  <item>
    <title>077.去选择你的人生吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a858cc5fb87252df2ec710f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a858cc5fb87252df2ec710f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 11:04:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔好久的一期生活近况汇报+人生感悟大杂烩with</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/637223840f437bc9325fb307" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/637223840f437bc9325fb307"><span>棠棠</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a>谢胜子原文：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft86mFGG5WpoBAuv-0aANPbrlNXl.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 找到你满意的环境</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 对生活的满意度取决于是不是你自己的选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 🎻“人生不需要那么多退路，就往前走吧”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 柚子正在写作的路上⬇️</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOyZ2hNwbv7jmO5RleeVKw_hcEL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 咨询是去购买人生经验——“你可以去做喜欢的事”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 信念问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3764">01:02:44</a> 每一个都比之前更接近于「我」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">01:15:00</a> 哈利波特的魔杖🪄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">01:30:00</a> 写东西是一个剔除自己杂质的过程</span></p><p></p><p><span>bgm.《Love Me More》</span></p><p></p><p><span>七夕快乐🕊️🕊️🕊️祝愿大家梦想成真</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63616e304464651e0b97d18a/ls8r5hnnpPXJIy3Ca-OfGcPBY7P8.m4a" length="88655240" type="audio/mp4"/>
